%% sequence_agentic_recovery.mmd v2
%% v2 changes vs v1:
%%   added Trace participant showing shared_trace JSONL append per stage
%%   enumerated the 7 ReversibilityProfile fields read at decision time
%%   added dual-route inverse for scenario E (O2 IMS rollback AND TMF921 cancellation)
%% The undo. Operator decides 30 minutes after the apply that the fix produced unintended
%% side effects and wants to walk it back.
%% Surgical, per-action. Twin-validated inverse. This is Agentic Recoverability, not DR.
%% Companion to trust_loop.md (Activity 3) and harness/schemas/ReversibilityProfile.json.

sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as NOC Operator
    participant Guard as Guardrail Engine
    participant Twin as Digital Twin
    participant OCloud as O-Cloud Manager (O2 IMS)
    participant SMO as Partner SMO (TMF921)
    participant Edge as Edge (linuxptp + cloud-event-proxy)
    participant Gateway as Agentic Gateway
    participant Trace as Trace JSONL (shared_trace/*.jsonl)

    Op->>Op: decides rollback needed
    Op->>Guard: rollback request citing AuditEvent eventId
    Guard->>Guard: load event.remediation.reversibility_profile
    Note over Guard: 7 fields read at decision time, no vendor doc lookup:<br/>rollback_intent, blast_radius_if_reverse, rebuild_timeline,<br/>replication_history, validation_history, risk_profile_burn_down,<br/>confidence_in_reversibility
    Guard->>Trace: append rollback_requested
    Guard->>Twin: inverse action validation request
    Twin->>Twin: run inverse against current cluster state snapshot
    Twin-->>Guard: rollback-safe signal
    Guard->>Trace: append twin_inverse_verdict
    Guard->>OCloud: apply inverse via O2 IMS (DOWN route)
    OCloud->>Edge: inverse MachineConfig or KMM Module CR or HostFirmwareComponents
    alt original action was apply_metal3_firmware (scenario E)
        Guard->>SMO: TMF921 companion-intent cancellation (UP route)
        SMO-->>Guard: cancellation_id ack
        Guard->>Trace: append companion_intent_cancellation
    end
    Edge-->>Gateway: CloudEvent confirming pre-remediation state restored
    Gateway->>Trace: append rollback_converged
    Gateway->>Op: AuditEvent eventType RemediationRolledBack
    Note over Op,Gateway: Surgical, per-action, no full-failover step. Not DR.
